{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50783","headline":"观《山海图》二首 其一 · 张祜","name":"观《山海图》二首 其一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古色辨微茫，华夷在一堂。\n云霞开藻井，天地出雕梁。\n细草生毫末，轻风拂黛光。\n夜山犹带景，秋树不凋霜。\n隐竹才分翠，穠华欲堕香。\n无风帆自起，度日鸟空翔。\n舟势鲸吞久，楼形蜃吐长。\n更看台上镜，造化落中央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}